# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int elevatorRequests(int n, int[] requests) {
        int time = 0;
        int currentFloor = 0;

        for (int request : requests) {
            time += Math.abs(currentFloor - request);
            currentFloor = request;
        }

        return time;
    }
}
```
